[00:00.78]There was a reason why God brought the truth to you
[00:08.12]And called you from the darkness to the light.
[00:13.97]Within your heart, he saw the longing that you had
[00:21.46]To search for him and practice what is right.
[00:28.32]You promised him in prayer to do his will;
[00:34.86]He helped you then, and he will help you still.
[00:41.31](Chorus)
[00:41.46]With Jesus’ blood He bought you,
[00:44.55]to God you now belong.
[00:48.18]So he will make you firm,
[00:51.62]and he will make you strong.
[00:54.94]He’ll guide you and protect you,
[00:57.90]as he has all along.
[01:01.36]Yes, he will make you firm,
[01:06.50]and he will make you strong.
[01:54.46]God gave his own beloved Son in your behalf;
[01:57.97]On this account, He wants you to succeed.
[02:01.19]If He did not withhold the gift of His dear Son,
[02:04.90]Then never doubt He’ll give the strength you need.
[02:08.92]He won’t forget the faith and love you’ve shown;
[02:12.64]He will not fail to care for all His own.
